<li><p class='igt' id='i10'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/11.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i10w'><span class="word" id="i10w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i10w1">dinedhinh,</span><span class="word" id="i10w2">&quot;Gan</span><span class="word" id="i10w3">gon?&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i10w4">inedhinh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i10g'><span class="gloss" id="i10g0">so then</span><span class="gloss" id="i10g1">he thought thus</span><span class="gloss" id="i10g2">what</span><span class="gloss" id="i10g3">this</span><span class="gloss" id="i10g4">he thought</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i10ft'>'So he thought, &quot;what's this?&quot;'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i11'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/12.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i11w'><span class="word" id="i11w0">&quot;Dingit'a</span><span class="word" id="i11w1">dhisoniy,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i11w2">inedhinh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i11g'><span class="gloss" id="i11g0">better</span><span class="gloss" id="i11g1">I should eat it</span><span class="gloss" id="i11g2">he thought</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i11ft'>'I ought to eat it  he thought.'</span></p></li>
