<li><p class='igt' id='i14'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/15.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i14w'><span class="word" id="i14w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i14w1">viluxdong'</span><span class="word" id="i14w2">axa</span><span class="word" id="i14w3">xidinidltlux,</span><span class="word" id="i14w4">didag</span><span class="word" id="i14w5">q'idz.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i14g'><span class="gloss" id="i14g0">so then</span><span class="gloss" id="i14g1">some of it</span><span class="gloss" id="i14g2">with</span><span class="gloss" id="i14g3">he smeared on himself</span><span class="gloss" id="i14g4">his parka</span><span class="gloss" id="i14g5">on</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i14ft'>'And then he smeared some of it on his parka.'<a href="#n2" class="notelink">2</a></span></p></li>
