<li><p class='igt' id='i18'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/19.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i18w'><span class="word" id="i18w0">Qay</span><span class="word" id="i18w1">xodo'</span><span class="word" id="i18w2">ghinoy</span><span class="word" id="i18w3">tth'in</span><span class="word" id="i18w4">xit'aghdingiɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i18g'><span class="gloss" id="i18g0">village</span><span class="gloss" id="i18g1">downriver from</span><span class="gloss" id="i18g2">caribou</span><span class="gloss" id="i18g3">bones</span><span class="gloss" id="i18g4">they were dumped out</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i18ft'>'Downriver from the settlement caribou bones were dumped out.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i19'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/20.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i19w'><span class="word" id="i19w0">Yuxodoɬts'in</span><span class="word" id="i19w1">guq'ux</span><span class="word" id="i19w2">chux</span><span class="word" id="i19w3">axaxiɬdik.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i19g'><span class="gloss" id="i19g0">on the downriver side of it</span><span class="gloss" id="i19g1">fat</span><span class="gloss" id="i19g2">it's big</span><span class="gloss" id="i19g3">also</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i19ft'>'Downriver from it was a lot of fat too.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i20'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/21.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i20w'><span class="word" id="i20w0">&quot;Gan</span><span class="word" id="i20w1">gon?&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i20w2">inedhinh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i20g'><span class="gloss" id="i20g0">what</span><span class="gloss" id="i20g1">this</span><span class="gloss" id="i20g2">he thought</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i20ft'>&quot;'What's this?&quot; he thought.'</span></p></li>
