<li><p class='igt' id='i69'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/70.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i69w'><span class="word" id="i69w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i69w1">anh</span><span class="word" id="i69w2">dina</span><span class="word" id="i69w3">tadhiyo,</span><span class="word" id="i69w4">diniyhdi</span><span class="word" id="i69w5">dran.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i69g'><span class="gloss" id="i69g0">and then</span><span class="gloss" id="i69g1">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i69g2">man</span><span class="gloss" id="i69g3">he went on</span><span class="gloss" id="i69g4">four</span><span class="gloss" id="i69g5">day</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i69ft'>'The man kept on going for four days.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i70'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/71.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i70w'><span class="word" id="i70w0">Dran-gigheyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i70g'><span class="gloss" id="i70g0">he walked all day</span><span class="gloss" id="i70g1"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i70ft'>'He walked all day.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i71'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/72.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i71w'><span class="word" id="i71w0">Gan</span><span class="word" id="i71w1">ine'</span><span class="word" id="i71w2">itltthagits'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i71g'><span class="gloss" id="i71g0">anything</span><span class="gloss" id="i71g1">even</span><span class="gloss" id="i71g2">he didn't see</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i71ft'>'He didn't see a single thing.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i72'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/73.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i72w'><span class="word" id="i72w0">Detsan'</span><span class="word" id="i72w1">ts'ixiyiɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i72g'><span class="gloss" id="i72g0">he's hungry</span><span class="gloss" id="i72g1">too</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i72ft'>'He was hungry too.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i73'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/74.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i73w'><span class="word" id="i73w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i73w1">inedhinh,</span><span class="word" id="i73w2">&quot;idisre'</span><span class="word" id="i73w3">ɬo,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i73w4">inedhinh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i73g'><span class="gloss" id="i73g0">and then</span><span class="gloss" id="i73g1">he thought</span><span class="gloss" id="i73g2">I wonder</span><span class="gloss" id="i73g3">true</span><span class="gloss" id="i73g4">he thought</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i73ft'>'Then he began to think &quot;I wonder if it's true.&quot;'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i74'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/75.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i74w'><span class="word" id="i74w0">Yitongo</span><span class="word" id="i74w1">vogh</span><span class="word" id="i74w2">tiyh</span><span class="word" id="i74w3">qul.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i74g'><span class="gloss" id="i74g0">meanwhile</span><span class="gloss" id="i74g1">for him</span><span class="gloss" id="i74g2">strength</span><span class="gloss" id="i74g3">none</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i74ft'>'His strength was failing.'</span></p></li>
