<li><p class='igt' id='i103'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/104.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i103w'><span class="word" id="i103w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i103w1">yit</span><span class="word" id="i103w2">axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i103w3">viɬantl'idaq.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i103g'><span class="gloss" id="i103g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i103g1">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i103g2">and then</span><span class="gloss" id="i103g3">he fell asleep</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i103ft'>'Then he fell asleep there.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i104'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/105.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i104w'><span class="word" id="i104w0">Tr'an'ididhit</span><span class="word" id="i104w1">uxuxiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i104w2">gidetth'onh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i104g'><span class="gloss" id="i104g0">he awoke</span><span class="gloss" id="i104g1">and</span><span class="gloss" id="i104g2">he listened</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i104ft'>'When he awoke he listened.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i105'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/106.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i105w'><span class="word" id="i105w0">Ngitthedz</span><span class="word" id="i105w1">tr'odiɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i105g'><span class="gloss" id="i105g0">from below</span><span class="gloss" id="i105g1">someone is coming</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i105ft'>'Someone was coming below him.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i106'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/107.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i106w'><span class="word" id="i106w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i106w1">didighene'</span><span class="word" id="i106w2">uxuxiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i106w3">gitadhon'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i106g'><span class="gloss" id="i106g0">and then</span><span class="gloss" id="i106g1">he called out</span><span class="gloss" id="i106g2">and then</span><span class="gloss" id="i106g3">he started to eat</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i106ft'>'He called out and he started to eat.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i107'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/108.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i107w'><span class="word" id="i107w0">&quot;Gan</span><span class="word" id="i107w1">go</span><span class="word" id="i107w2">di'ne</span><span class="word" id="i107w3">iy?&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i107w4">xiyiɬne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i107g'><span class="gloss" id="i107g0">what</span><span class="gloss" id="i107g1">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i107g2">he says</span><span class="gloss" id="i107g3">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i107g4">they said of him</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i107ft'>&quot;'Who is saying that up there?&quot; somebody asked.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i108'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/109.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i108w'><span class="word" id="i108w0">&quot;Nigeday</span><span class="word" id="i108w1">xiq'iy</span><span class="word" id="i108w2">ɬo'its'iy,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i108w3">yiɬne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i108g'><span class="gloss" id="i108g0">hawk</span><span class="gloss" id="i108g1">like it</span><span class="gloss" id="i108g2">it seems</span><span class="gloss" id="i108g3">they said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i108ft'>&quot;'It sounds like a hawk person,&quot; he said.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i109'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/110.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i109w'><span class="word" id="i109w0">&quot;Dingit'a</span><span class="word" id="i109w1">vitl'ogitr'atotriɬ.&quot;</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i109g'><span class="gloss" id="i109g0">better</span><span class="gloss" id="i109g1">we should give it food</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i109ft'>&quot;'We ought to give it food.&quot;'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i110'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/111.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i110w'><span class="word" id="i110w0">Yitots'in</span><span class="word" id="i110w1">yitl'ogidighetrit.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i110g'><span class="gloss" id="i110g0">so then</span><span class="gloss" id="i110g1">he gave him food</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i110ft'>'So they gave him food.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i111'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/112.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i111w'><span class="word" id="i111w0">Xitathdatl</span><span class="word" id="i111w1">yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i111w2">ngidigg</span><span class="word" id="i111w3">srixno'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i111g'><span class="gloss" id="i111g0">they started going</span><span class="gloss" id="i111g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i111g2">up</span><span class="gloss" id="i111g3">creek</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i111ft'>'They left going up the creek.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i112'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/113.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i112w'><span class="word" id="i112w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i112w1">dina</span><span class="word" id="i112w2">viɬantl'idaq</span><span class="word" id="i112w3">chenh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i112g'><span class="gloss" id="i112g0">and then</span><span class="gloss" id="i112g1">man</span><span class="gloss" id="i112g2">he went to sleep</span><span class="gloss" id="i112g3">again</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i112ft'>'The man fell asleep again.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i113'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/114.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i113w'><span class="word" id="i113w0">Tr'an'ididhit</span><span class="word" id="i113w1">vogh'egh</span><span class="word" id="i113w2">vav</span><span class="word" id="i113w3">long</span><span class="word" id="i113w4">lighan</span><span class="word" id="i113w5">yiɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i113g'><span class="gloss" id="i113g0">he awoke</span><span class="gloss" id="i113g1">around him</span><span class="gloss" id="i113g2">food</span><span class="gloss" id="i113g3">much</span><span class="gloss" id="i113g4">fat</span><span class="gloss" id="i113g5">also</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i113ft'>'When he awoke there was a lot of food around him and fat as well.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i114'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/115.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i114w'><span class="word" id="i114w0">Yogh</span><span class="word" id="i114w1">srigidithddhet</span><span class="word" id="i114w2">aɬixi</span><span class="word" id="i114w3">niynelo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i114g'><span class="gloss" id="i114g0">for it</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g1">he was thankful</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g2">together</span><span class="gloss" id="i114g3">he gathered it</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i114ft'>'He was thankful for it as he gathered it together.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i115'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/116.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i115w'><span class="word" id="i115w0">Yitots'in</span><span class="word" id="i115w1">yitadhon'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i115g'><span class="gloss" id="i115g0">and then</span><span class="gloss" id="i115g1">he began to eat it</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i115ft'>'He began to eat it.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i116'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/3__yixgitsiy_dina_diqay/mp3/117.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i116w'><span class="word" id="i116w0">Nigeday</span><span class="word" id="i116w1">ngilanh</span><span class="word" id="i116w2">ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i116w3">nat'uq.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i116g'><span class="gloss" id="i116g0">hawk</span><span class="gloss" id="i116g1">he is</span><span class="gloss" id="i116g2"></span><span class="gloss" id="i116g3">he flew off</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i116ft'>'And then he became a hawk and flew away.'</span></p></li>
</ol></div><div id='notes'><h2>Notes</h2><ol><li><span class="footnote" id="n1">Chapman: 'He was not expecting to see anybody.'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n2">Kari (based on Chapman) has <em> xidinitltlux </em> 'he smeared'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n3">Kari has <em> anh 'he/she'. Chapman has </em> ăhn.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n4">Chapman's version combines this sentence with the next: 'I believe that there are more skins at my village than there are at your village.' Kari's version ends this sentence with <em> ngidiggi.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n5">Kari (based on Chapman) has <em> tr'ot'ix </em> 'it's bad'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n6">RD says <em> yughun' </em> 'by him/her'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n7">Kari has <em> ine' </em> 'even' (based on Chapman's <em>ĭnnĭˊ'-i </em> 'whatever'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n8"><em> gidi </em> in the title appears to be a reduced form of <em> gidegh </em> 'away'</span></li></ol>
</div>
</div>
